{"turn_id": "d01-t1", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_use", "text": "作者使用美国劳工统计局（BLS）的职业列表以及各职业中女性参与比例的数据，将其与翻译输出中女性代词出现频率进行比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "real_world_distribution_comparison", "text": "作者将翻译所得的女性代词分布与BLS各职业女性参与数据并排绘制直方图，发现谷歌翻译输出未能遵循各职业中女性工人的真实分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "作者比较女性工人分布与女性翻译频率，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性，并指出谷歌翻译低估了预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "data_origin_us", "text": "用于对照的人口统计数据来源是美国劳工统计局（U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics）的数据，而非按使用性别中性语言的国家分别采集的数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "country_analysis_absent", "text": "在所提供的摘要、结论及比较章节文本中，未见作者针对使用性别中性语言的具体国家分别考察该国女性工人的实际分布；证据仅提及与BLS数据的比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t2", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_source_and_job_list", "text": "作者以美国劳工统计局（BLS）的职业列表为起点，并用它来构造如“He/She is an Engineer”这类句子，目标语言为12种性别中性语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "bls_female_participation_data", "text": "BLS数据包含各职业类别中女性参与比例的统计，作者据此计算每个12分位数上女性参与的频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "comparison_with_bls", "text": "作者将翻译输出中女性代词频率与BLS各职业女性参与频率进行比较，发现二者没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_distribution", "text": "作者报告称，Google Translate的输出未能反映女性工人的真实世界分布，并且低估了预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "histogram_comparison", "text": "作者把翻译女性代词频率的直方图与BLS女性参与频率的直方图并排绘制：翻译的女性代词集中在第1个12分位数，而BLS数据显示女性参与在第4个12分位数达到峰值，并在之后各分位数保持显著。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "male_defaults_exceed_demographics", "text": "作者指出，即使不预期性别代词呈50:50分布，Google Translate产生男性默认的频率也高于仅凭人口统计数据所预期的水平。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "assumption_for_bias", "text": "作者明确假设：翻译代词分布可以偏离50:50，但不应偏离到歪曲职业人口统计的程度；若男性默认频率高估了某职业中男性雇员对女性雇员的（可能不平等的）分布，则认定Google Translate存在负向性别偏见。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-bf50e77dea8722dc9d0a44b4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
